{"claim_id":"CLM-GPU-NVDA-Q2FY27-SUPPLY-COMMITMENTS","bom_node_id":"gpu_asic","lens_id":"supply","source_id":"SRC-WEB-NVDA-Q2FY27-10Q-20260826","published_at":"2026-08-26","effective_period":"截至2026-07-26及2027财年Q3","target_period":"未来数年","ingested_at":"2026-08-28","material_class":"official_filing","ingestion_channel":"question_search","claim_type":"supply_commitment","stance":"neutral","source_title":"NVIDIA Form 10-Q（截至2026年7月26日季度）","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000075/nvda-20260726.htm","source_location":"第17、25页，Note 10及Recent Developments","statement":"NVIDIA称Rubin在Q3 FY27开始生产发货，同时Blackwell与Rubin仍面临部分供应约束；为满足未来数年需求，公司把供应与产能承诺从上季度1190亿美元提高到2790亿美元，主要覆盖内存和制造设施。部分协议在正式下单前可以取消、改期或调整。该披露证明供给扩张正在加速，但缺少端到端交期、价格、客户等待时间和库存消化，不能直接判定最终系统供给仍低于订单。","review_status":"gpt_verified"}
{"claim_id":"CLM-GPU-NVDA-Q2FY27-DATACENTER-READINESS","bom_node_id":"gpu_asic","lens_id":"supply","source_id":"SRC-WEB-NVDA-Q2FY27-10Q-20260826","published_at":"2026-08-26","effective_period":"2026-08","target_period":"2029财年起","ingested_at":"2026-08-28","material_class":"official_filing","ingestion_channel":"question_search","claim_type":"datacenter_readiness_commitment","stance":"neutral","source_title":"NVIDIA Form 10-Q（截至2026年7月26日季度）","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000075/nvda-20260726.htm","source_location":"第18、26页，Additional Commitments and Guarantees、Recent Developments","statement":"NVIDIA明确把土地、电力、园区外壳和资本列为AI基础设施部署关键条件，并称这些短缺可推迟客户上线和收入。公司在2026年8月为SB Energy俄亥俄PORTS项目约4.25GW IT负载提供信用支持，园区原则上由OpenAI签署20年租约，NVIDIA担保总额上限1050亿美元；九座数据中心预计自2029财年开始陆续投入服务。该项目缓解未来场地约束，也显示设备需求需要大规模长期担保才能落地。","review_status":"gpt_verified"}
{"claim_id":"CLM-GPU-NVDA-Q2FY27-CHINA-ACCESS","bom_node_id":"gpu_asic","lens_id":"esg","source_id":"SRC-WEB-NVDA-Q2FY27-10Q-20260826","published_at":"2026-08-26","effective_period":"2027财年上半年及Q2","target_period":"","ingested_at":"2026-08-28","material_class":"official_filing","ingestion_channel":"question_search","claim_type":"market_access_constraint","stance":"refute","source_title":"NVIDIA Form 10-Q（截至2026年7月26日季度）","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000075/nvda-20260726.htm","source_location":"第26页，Recent Developments","statement":"NVIDIA披露美国许可允许向特定中国客户小量发运H200，但受中国政府限制，获许可产品未能全部销售；2027财年上半年因H200需求下降计提4亿美元库存及采购义务费用，Q2实际H200发运不足数据中心收入1%，且美国检查流程触发25%进口关税，公司无法向客户转嫁。公司判断当前实际上无法在中国数据中心计算市场竞争。","review_status":"gpt_verified"}
